Encoding: UTF-8
Maintainer: Gael Millot <gael.millot@pasteur.fr>
Description: the make function convert a user function according to the safer-r project recommendations (see <https://github.com/safer-r>). This includes checking argument values, ensuring correct specification of all mandatory arguments for embedded functions, as well as their explicit package namespace qualification, among other things.
